xt_en":"Dense fog has reduced visibility to near-zero over parts of southeast Saskatchewan.\n\nThe fog is expected to lift late in the afternoon.\n\nTravel will likely be hazardous. Visibility will likely be suddenly reduced at times.\n\nBe prepared for areas of near-zero visibility and allow extra time to reach your destination. If driving, turn on your lights, slow down and maintain a safe following distance.\n\nFog advisories are issued when widespread poor visibility in fog is expected.\n\nPlease continue to monitor alerts and forecasts issued by Environment Canada. To report severe weather, send an email to SKstorm@ec.gc.ca, call 1-800-239-0484 or post reports on social media using #SKStorm.","alert_text_fr":"Du brouillard dense a rendu la visibilit\u00e9 presque nulle sur certaines parties du sud-est de la Saskatchewan.\n\nLe brouillard devrait se dissiper en fin d'apr\u00e8s-midi.\n\nLes d\u00e9placements seront probablement dangereux. Une visibilit\u00e9 soudainement r\u00e9duite par moments est \u00e0 pr\u00e9voir.\n\nSoyez pr\u00eats \u00e0 composer avec des zones o\u00f9 la visibilit\u00e9 est quasi nulle et pr\u00e9voyez plus de temps pour vous rendre \u00e0 destination. Si vous conduisez, allumez vos phares, ralentissez et maintenez une distance s\u00e9curitaire.\n\nUn avis de brouillard est \u00e9mis lorsqu'une mauvaise visibilit\u00e9 g\u00e9n\u00e9ralis\u00e9e due au brouillard est pr\u00e9vue.\n\nVeuillez continuer \u00e0 surveiller les alertes et les pr\u00e9visions \u00e9mises par Environnement Canada. Pour signaler du temps violent, envoyez un courriel \u00e0 meteoSK@ec.gc.ca, appelez au 1-800-239-0484 ou publiez un message sur les r\u00e9seaux sociaux en utilisant #SKMeteo.","risk_colour_en":"yellow","risk_colour_fr":"jaune","confidence_en":null,"confidence_fr":null,"impact_en":null,"impact_fr":null,"feature_name_en":"R.M. of Antler including Redvers Antler and Wauchope","feature_name_fr":"m.r. d'Antler incluant Redvers Antler et Wauchope","prov